Milestone 1: Identify the types of image issues with 1 specific example of each

A. Physical Variation:
1. Stains (includes smudges, oil)
2. Lineweight variation
3. Shading variation (this is global)
4. Wall drawing convention variation (distance between lines, count of lines, dashes vs fill, type of dashes; this is global)
5. Ink drops (A1)
6. Unofficial text (also bleed through)
7. Unofficial lines, graphics
8. Stamps
9. Non-straight lines (A1)

B. Image Degradation:
1. Shading desaturation (A3)
2. Lineweight desaturation (A2)
3. Folds

C. Image Capture Variation:
1. Brightness variation (this is global)
2. Contrast variation (this is global)
3. Noise (A1)

D. Not in Scope at the moment:
1. Symbols
2. Words
3. Sections of buildings missing
4. Scale missing
5. Scale variation
6. Orientation missing
7. Orientation variation
8. Key plan missing

